    answer: "No. Interception controls pausing. History can still record the browser's proxied traffic, which is the simplest mode for this lesson.",
    aiPrompt: "Walk me through Burp's built-in browser and HTTP history for my local lab, one click at a time. If the page hangs, ask whether Intercept is on before proposing network changes.",
    sources: [{ title: "PortSwigger: Burp's browser", url: "https://portswigger.net/burp/documentation/desktop/tools/burps-browser" }, { title: "PortSwigger: intercepting traffic", url: "https://portswigger.net/burp/documentation/desktop/getting-started/intercepting-http-traffic" }],
